# Source is LF everywhere. A contribution from a Windows checkout converted two dozen files to CRLF,
# which breaks nothing at compile time and everything that matches against file content - patches,
# greps, and review diffs that show every line as changed.
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.mm text eol=lf
*.proto text eol=lf
*.cmake text eol=lf
CMakeLists.txt text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
